{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b700854a48ea7ee35e846ce394bf2917daec579c28efbd31d46765e717235e7a", "ja": "（野外ライブのリハーサルが終わった。\n本番は気温もライブも、更に熱くなりそうだな！）", "zh": "（户外演唱会的彩排结束了。\n正式演出时，气温和现场气氛都要变得更加火热了吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1001_p", "source_sha256": "28f42a10e232290944ebf097780890958aa75185847d2770347ab7df4146fab5", "ja": "お疲れ様、朋花。今いいか？\n朋花のソロのところなんだけど、少し変更を……。", "zh": "辛苦了，朋花。现在方便吗？\n关于朋花的独唱部分，我想稍微做些调整……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fdce555336675ddaeb31c462a3b2c8938d0783d3b788c9d38db14a97321aba59", "ja": "ん？　……朋花？", "zh": "嗯？……朋花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "08b37034aba4bb45220b0a2e3c7ab5df7297c6234fae385fd24745a68486c674", "ja": "……あら？\n{$P$}さん……？", "zh": "……哎呀？\n{$P$}先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a06be0702b75b8ba37f920ca2f6dbdb0ba01ae46d56d2f1adc2156a238892bbb", "ja": "あっ……ごめん、朋花。\nもしかして、寝てたのか？", "zh": "啊……抱歉，朋花。\n你刚才是不是睡着了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "e6bf75cb213155adeeb7c2672b2a376e428a1834bb78079b2c86dbe164743f44", "ja": "ええ、そのようです～。休憩しているうちに、\nいつのまにか眠っていたみたいですね～。", "zh": "是的，看来是这样呢～。休息着休息着，不知不觉就睡着了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "28f13d54433791d43d01a36c3c011624c14d33b8c72a28552f3fecb990d20071", "ja": "それより、まつりさんと美也さんを知りませんか～？\nさっきまで、一緒にいたはずなんですけど……。", "zh": "比起这个，您知道まつり和美也在哪里吗～？\n刚才明明还和她们在一起的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f9dcd24b0582f57b6a5c92c6ffd3af0f168163b1980ecac9ac50e1a5d05c6a52", "ja": "俺が来た時には、ふたりともいなかったよ。\nけど、朋花がうたた寝なんて珍しいな……疲れたか？", "zh": "我来的时候，她们两个都不在。\n不过，朋花居然在打瞌睡，真少见啊……是累了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "d803095600231ad4be518d619fb80bf3f3d87f949508f5b85989b6d7a79f1230", "ja": "そうですね～。この暑さですから～。\nけど、そんなに心配しなくても大丈夫ですよ～。", "zh": "是啊～天气这么热嘛～  \n不过，您不用那么担心，我没事的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1010_p", "source_sha256": "faa8c549efd1c4dad9e5caf5a5e754b4e1a6ae76fa9272dfc96cd92088cf7dc5", "ja": "そうか。まだ時間はあるし、\nもう少し休んでいても大丈夫だけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。时间还早，\n再多休息一会儿也没关系，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "0e5720b566ff832560cf292b53c8875b9f5912eacb6d6718fe961490760830b1", "ja": "私も、そうしたいのですが……\nすこし、困ったことになりました～。", "zh": "我也想这样做，可是……\n遇到了一点麻烦呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1012_p", "source_sha256": "34e1e260b478031bfe42990b06479cc82b0887610d285f4579f8f870809e920e", "ja": "えっ？　何か問題か……？", "zh": "咦？出什么问题了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "f5bde15a51ed3d4c28e2315b4680387cb36f9861c75ce1ad4e85a1a89320ac27", "ja": "ええ。聖母のプライベートをのぞいた、不届き者が\nいるんですよ～。寝顔を見られてしまったので～。", "zh": "嗯。有个不知分寸的人偷看了圣母的私人时光呢～因为被看到了睡脸嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9fff2040c7fd9c3d2184ce287d916488e2835089a47e02627f77942cb317dee1", "ja": "あっ！　……いや、寝顔は見てないから！\n寝てるのかなと思っただけで……。", "zh": "啊！……不对，我没看你的睡相啦！\n只是在想你是不是睡着了而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "2c97bdd1c3131cf8681dc8908841adc44027f0980414dc0c56e02ac82d294188", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？\n言い訳してはダメですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？\n不可以找借口哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "27510b5713dd40efccbb04d5e193a64cdec333738fbb74735dce64b74f22363a", "ja": "仕方がありませんので、{$P$}さん\nには、挽回のチャンスをあげましょう～。", "zh": "既然没办法，就给{$P$}先生一个挽回的机会吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "f116bd0432f14d7e2fc0a7c275c72312008391157f95137793c33e15d9e400d6", "ja": "私が今、何をして欲しいかわかったら……\nお仕置きは、許してあげますよ～？", "zh": "如果你能猜到我现在想要什么……\n就原谅你的惩罚哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4c5b980caf1914a2ca4a667ba872ae5510504db1bf8b55aa46ca72de5b4234d6", "ja": "朋花がして欲しい事……あっ、喉は渇いてないか？\nドリンクならあるぞ！", "zh": "朋花想要我做的事……啊，你不渴吧？\n饮料的话我这里有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "862b634d0a565976905b0e396a163a8a18c3ce17061636f95b40a04d16a27340", "ja": "うふふ、及第点ですよ～。\nでは、いただきますね……あら～？", "zh": "呵呵，算您及格了哦～。\n那我就不客气了……哎呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1f0402ea863032cec6ea72a76d9300ba43eb74e4077fabaaff2a509854f5d706", "ja": "あっ……ご、ごめん。\nこれ、まつりのドリンクだったな……。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起。\n这个是茉莉的饮料吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "5e951fb7f2c1b8f09648862108a7e9e3cb42e0271b61d7e96d368b9114ae3909", "ja": "聖母の期待に応える仕事をしたかと思ったのに……\n詰めが甘いですね～、ダメプロデューサー？", "zh": "我还以为你完成了回应圣母期待的工作呢……没想到最后关头还是不够仔细呢～，没用的制作人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0164_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "35efb0c795d338a75a83e5ed81c4fd44e74978af047aa600c586710905b1dbc7", "ja": "今度、期待はずれの仕事をしたその時は……\nきつく、お仕置きですからね～？　うふふっ♪", "zh": "下次要是再做出令人失望的工作……  \n可要狠狠惩罚你了哦～？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
